01:18.791 --> 01:20.416
Jangan mengelak!

01:20.500 --> 01:21.583
Dia tumbuk lagi!

01:21.666 --> 01:23.958
Kalau nak kena, baik aku cuba…

01:24.041 --> 01:26.166
Tumbukan paling kuat

01:26.250 --> 01:28.541
