01:36.250 --> 01:40.166
Ia dipanggil kaedah
"cara ditumbuk tanpa rasa sakit".

01:40.250 --> 01:41.458
Betul kata dia.

01:41.958 --> 01:44.083
Memang tak sakit.

01:44.166 --> 01:46.250
